Subject: usb: cdns3: restore remaining sky1-next cdns3/cdnsp files for
 consistency

cdns3-plat.c/cdns3-gadget.c/cdnsp-pci.c still referenced 7.2 struct fields
(host_init, no_drd, cdns_core_init_role) absent from the restored sky1-next
core.h. Restore them too so the whole cdns3 dir is internally consistent.
